  "solution": "Series: 256, 211, 166, 121, 76, ?\n\nConstant difference pattern\n\n256 → 211\n\n⇒ 256 − 45 = 211\n\n211 → 166\n\n⇒ 211 − 45 = 166\n\n166 → 121\n\n⇒ 166 − 45 = 121\n\n121 → 76\n\n⇒ 121 − 45 = 76\n\n76 → ?\n\n⇒ 76 − 45 = 31\n\n**∴ Missing number = 31.**\n\nHence the correct answer is** Option 3.**",
